WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:08,640
doomsday

2
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,600
Zhang Xiaoxiao, you are really crazy

3
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:15,220
Don't look for me if you're crazy

4
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,700
Can you have some common sense?

5
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:18,180
Can you please leave me alone?

6
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:20,450
Can you give me a new life?

7
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:22,410
Don't disturb my life again

8
00:00:22,410 --> 00:00:23,930
Your brothers and sisters are still young

9
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:25,330
I still need to take care of them

10
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:27,090
Already very annoyed and tired

11
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:28,450
If you have anything to do, go see your dad.

12
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:30,170
You are not my only child

13
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:32,290
You are as suffocating as your father

14
00:00:32,290 --> 00:00:34,690
When I saw your news, I felt sick all over.

15
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:37,010
Some things don’t need to be said too bluntly

16
00:00:37,010 --> 00:00:40,090
Can you have a life of your own? Why don't you get married?

17
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:45,390
Let me beg you

18
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:47,640
The end is coming

19
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:51,100
It’s also my new film

20
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:56,130
Since you won't take me with you

21
00:00:56,130 --> 00:01:10,700
Then say goodbye to the past

22
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:12,500
Obviously relaxed

23
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:18,690
Why is my heart still empty?

24
00:01:18,690 --> 00:01:19,890
Don’t you even say you can’t leave the city?

25
00:01:19,890 --> 00:01:20,930
Why is this blocked?

26
00:01:20,930 --> 00:01:22,930
When it comes to relationships, people say one thing and do another.

27
00:01:22,930 --> 00:01:26,370
Too exaggerated

28
00:01:26,370 --> 00:01:29,020
It's good to go quickly in this situation

29
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:30,220
The queue in front is not too long
